              <span class="absolute top-1.5 -left-[1.57rem] size-3 rounded-full border-2 border-background bg-accent"></span>
              <strong class="text-primary">1958</strong>
              <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground">A Casa recebe um diploma de gratidão da Faculdade de Medicina da Bahia.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="relative">
              <span class="absolute top-1.5 -left-[1.57rem] size-3 rounded-full border-2 border-background bg-primary"></span>
              <strong class="text-primary">Hoje</strong>
              <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground">A mesma família, agora com catálogo digital e atendimento pelo WhatsApp.</p>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-b bg-background">
      <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:py-18">
        <div>
          <Badge variant="secondary">Marcas parceiras</Badge>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl">Qualidade reconhecida em cada categoria</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground lg:text-nowrap">
            Trabalhamos com marcas consolidadas em produtos de saúde, ortopedia, cuidado e compressão.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-9">
          <BrandCarousel client:visible />
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="#categorias" class={cn(buttonVariants({ size: "lg" }), "h-12 px-6")}>
            Conheça nosso catálogo
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-b bg-secondary/40">
      <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-5 py-14 text-center sm:px-6 lg:py-18">
        <div class="mx-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-background px-4 py-2 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex gap-0.5 text-accent">
            {Array.from({ length: 5 }).map(() => (
              <Star className="size-4" fill="currentColor" />
            ))}
          </div>
          <img src="/icons/google.svg" alt="Google" class="size-5" />
        </div>
        <h2 class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl">
          Quem já visitou recomenda
        </h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground lg:text-nowrap">
          Depoimentos reais de clientes atendidos na loja, publicados no Google.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-9 text-left">
          <GoogleReviewsCarousel client:visible />
        </div>

        <a
          href={GOOGLE_REVIEW_URL}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          data-review-cta
          class={cn(buttonVariants({ variant: "outline", size: "lg" }), "mt-8 gap-2 rounded-full")}
        >
          <img src="/icons/google.svg" alt="" class="size-4" />
          Avalie a gente
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contato" class="scroll-mt-32 bg-foreground text-background">
      <div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-7xl gap-10 px-5 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(420px,1.1fr)] lg:items-center lg:py-20">
        <div class="max-w-xl">
          <Badge className="bg-background/10 text-background ring-1 ring-background/20">Estamos no Centro de BH</Badge>
          <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl">
            Visite a loja ou chame a gente
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-background/70">
            Conte o que você procura. A equipe confirma as opções disponíveis e ajuda a preparar seu atendimento.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a
              href={WHATSAPP_URL}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class={cn(buttonVariants({ size: "lg" }), "h-11 px-4")}
            >
              <img src="/icons/whatsapp.svg" alt="" class="size-5" />
              Falar no WhatsApp
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Av.%20Afonso%20Pena%2C%20981%2C%20Belo%20Horizonte"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class={cn(
                buttonVariants({ variant: "outline", size: "lg" }),
                "h-11 border-background/25 bg-transparent px-4 text-background hover:bg-background/10 hover:text-background"
              )}
            >
              Como chegar
              <ArrowRight className="size-4" />
            </a>
          </div>

          <GoogleReviewCta />
        </div>

        <Card className="aspect-[16/10] gap-0 overflow-hidden bg-background py-0 text-foreground shadow-2xl sm:aspect-[16/9]">
          <iframe
            src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=Av.+Afonso+Pena,+981,+Belo+Horizonte,+MG&output=embed"
            title="Localização da Casa do Médico BH no mapa"
            loading="lazy"
            referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
            class="h-full w-full border-0"
          ></iframe>
        </Card>
      </div>
